hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1504","It was narrated from 'Abbad bin Tamim:\\""Sufyan said: 'I asked 'Abdullah bin Abi Bakr who said: I heard it from Abbad bin Tamim who narrated it from his father"""
"1505","It was narrated from Hisham bin Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Kinanah that :His father said: \\""So and so sent me to ask him how the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prayed for rain (Istisqa').\""\"" He said: 'The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out beseeching and humble"""
"1506","It was narrated from Abdullah bin Zaid that:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prayed for rain wearing a black khamisah"
"1507","It was narrated from Hisham binIshaq bin Abdullah bin Kinanah that:His father said: \\""I asked Ibn 'Abbas how the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prayed for rain. He said: 'The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out (dressed) in a state of humility"""
"1508","It was narrated from Abbad bin Tamim that :His paternal uncle had told him that he went out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) to pray for rain. He turned his rida' around"
"1509","It was narrated from Abbad bin Tamim that :His paternal uncle had told him that he went out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) to pray for rain. He turned his rida' around, and turned his back to the people, then he prayed two rak'ahs and recited loudly."
"1510","It was narrated from Abdullah bin Abi Bakr that:He heard Abbad bin Tamim said: \\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out and prayed for rain"""
"1511","It was narrated from Abdullah bin Abi Bakr that:He heard Abbad bin Tamim said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out and prayed for rain"," and he turned his rida' around when he turned to the Qiblah.\"""""
"1512","It was narrated that Anas said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did not raise his hands during any supplication except when praying for rain"""
"1513","It was narrated from Abi Al-Lahm that:He saw the Messenger of Allah at Ahjar Az-Zait praying for rain and raising his hands"
"1514","It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that he said:\\""While we were in the masjid on Friday and the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was addressing the people"""
"1515","It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that:The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \\""Allahumma sqina (O Allah"""
"1516","It was narrated from Thabit that Anas said:\\""The Prophet (ﷺ) was delivering the Khutbah one Friday when the people stood up and shouted: 'O Prophet of Allah! There has been no rain and the animals have died. Pray to Allah (SWT) to send us rain.' He said: 'O Allah"""
"1517","It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that:A man entered the masjid when the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was standing and delivering the Khutbah. He turned to face the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) standing and said: 'O Messenger of Allah"
"1518","It was narrated that Ibn Shihab said:\\""Abbad bin Tamim told me that he heard his paternal uncle"""
"1519","It was narrated from Abdullah bin Zaid that:The Prophet (ﷺ) went out to pray for rain"
"1520","It was narrated from Hisham bin Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Kinanah that:His father said: \\""One of the governors sent me to Ibn Abbas to ask him about the prayer for rain. He said: 'What kept him from asking me? The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went out humbly"""
"1521","It was narrated from 'Abbad bin Tamim from his paternal uncle that:The Prophet (ﷺ) went out and prayed for rain"
"1522","It was narrated from 'Aishah that:When it rained the Messenger of Allah would say: \\""Allahummaj'alhu Sayyiban nafi`a. (O Allah"""
"1523","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \""\""Allah"""
"1524","It was narrated that Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani said:\\""It rained during the time of the Prophet (ﷺ) and he said: 'Have you nt heard what your Lord said this night? He said: I have never sent down any blessing upon My slaves but some of them become disbelievers thereby"""
"1525","It was narrated that Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri said:\\""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: 'If Allah (SWT) were to withhold rain from His slaves for five years and then send it"""
"1526","It was narrated that Anas said:\\""There was no rain for a year"""
"1527","It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\\""There was a drought during the time of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). While the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was giving the Khutbah on the minbar one Friday"""
"1528","It was narrated that Tha'labah bin Zahdam said:\\""We were with Sa'eed bin Al-'Asi in Tabaristan"""
